"""Hard negatives for the artifact-intent gate: messages that NAME a file
format (or sound like a request for one) but must be answered in chat.

Authored for AS3 before the rules were changed, so the rules were not tuned
to these strings. No user content: every message is written for this set.

Fields: (id, text, ctx, category, lang)

ctx:
    P0          fresh chat
    PA          a substantial assistant answer precedes the message
    PF          published artifacts exist (and an answer)
    PU:<fmt>    a file of <fmt> is attached to THIS turn (no earlier answer)
category: upload_qa | how_to | trivia | feedback | code | chat
lang: en | hinglish | hi | gu | gujlish
"""
